WEBVTT

00:17.333 --> 00:18.160
Aunt,

00:18.519 --> 00:20.239
have a sip of tea and take your time.

00:22.280 --> 00:23.359
Three years ago,

00:23.960 --> 00:25.760
your eldest cousin
trusted the wrong people.

00:25.984 --> 00:27.640
He couldn't refuse them
out of politeness

00:28.600 --> 00:29.480
and was forced

00:29.960 --> 00:31.719
to ghostwrite that essay.

00:32.000 --> 00:33.600
Now, it's been dug up.

00:33.960 --> 00:34.799
You know

00:35.759 --> 00:38.000
your grandfather is strictly principled.

00:38.119 --> 00:40.200
He definitely won't step forward
to plead for him.

00:41.320 --> 00:44.119
Your uncle is furious,

00:44.359 --> 00:45.719
but he has no other way either.

00:46.200 --> 00:47.200
Xihe,

00:48.640 --> 00:51.000
I am truly at my wits' end.

00:51.000 --> 00:53.000
That's why I've come to beg you.

00:56.624 --> 00:58.720
Your Highness, I urge you
to consider carefully.

00:59.000 --> 01:01.079
There are three thousand candidates
this year.

01:01.320 --> 01:04.200
If, as you said, we
investigate this to the very end,

01:04.439 --> 01:05.200
I'm afraid

01:05.480 --> 01:07.120
half of the noble families

01:07.439 --> 01:09.079
will be wearing mourning clothes.

01:09.079 --> 01:09.840
Your Highness,

01:10.239 --> 01:12.719
the Censorate executed
twenty-seven people in seven days,

01:12.719 --> 01:14.200
causing a mutiny in the border army.

01:14.480 --> 01:16.879
Furthermore, corrupt officials
are using the fraud case

01:16.879 --> 01:18.239
to frame the loyal and good.

01:18.239 --> 01:20.840
I am not afraid of cutting out the sore,

01:20.840 --> 01:23.680
but of damaging the heart
and lungs in the process.

01:26.159 --> 01:29.599
We are willing to risk our lives
to guarantee a thorough investigation,

01:30.079 --> 01:32.439
but please make it clear, Your Highness.

01:32.799 --> 01:34.920
If the case reaches the Censorate

01:35.040 --> 01:37.879
and a prince's disciple passes a note,
what should be done?

01:38.200 --> 01:41.599
Can this executioner's blade
sever a golden chain?

01:42.840 --> 01:46.288
Harsh laws for urgent times,
gentle handling for delicate matters.

01:46.336 --> 01:47.640
Your Highness, it might be better

01:47.760 --> 01:50.439
to first execute
the seven confirmed corrupt officials

01:50.439 --> 01:52.000
to uphold the law,

01:52.640 --> 01:55.359
and as for the other involved scholars,

01:55.424 --> 01:57.430
(Sixian Hall)
send them to serve in the military.

01:58.560 --> 02:01.439
This fulfills your goal
of purging the selection process,

02:01.959 --> 02:05.280
while avoiding the risk
of alienating the noble families.

02:08.039 --> 02:08.680
Great.

02:11.879 --> 02:13.800
What a perfectly safe piece of advice.

02:14.080 --> 02:15.240
Do you all know

02:15.968 --> 02:17.430
how many innocent souls are buried

02:18.080 --> 02:19.680
in the fraud cases of past dynasties?

02:20.128 --> 02:22.800
The bribes in this year's examination
are piled to the ceiling.

02:23.080 --> 02:25.039
Even the children
in the streets are singing,

02:25.039 --> 02:28.280
"The rich claim the golden list,
while the poor bury their ink."

02:28.919 --> 02:30.919
My father implemented
the talent selection system

02:31.680 --> 02:32.840
to break

02:33.710 --> 02:35.552
the noble families' monopoly
on officialdom,

02:35.560 --> 02:37.520
giving students
from humble backgrounds a chance

02:37.530 --> 02:39.330
to realize their ambitions
and showcase their talents.

02:39.340 --> 02:41.350
Now, this buying and selling
of examination results

02:41.360 --> 02:44.070
is crueler than the harsh officials
in the Discourses on Salt and Iron.

02:44.080 --> 02:45.479
Poor scholars

02:45.759 --> 02:48.719
pour their hearts out
and study hard for a decade,

02:48.960 --> 02:50.840
only to end up as ghostwriters
for the rich.

02:52.159 --> 02:54.000
I'll lay it on the line today.

02:54.800 --> 02:56.639
Anyone involved
in this examination fraud,

02:57.080 --> 02:58.960
from nobles down to petty clerks,

02:58.960 --> 03:00.120
every single one of them

03:00.319 --> 03:01.280
will not be spared.

03:03.319 --> 03:04.199
Your Highness,

03:07.159 --> 03:09.000
Commandery Princess Zhaoning's cousin,

03:09.479 --> 03:11.280
Minister Tao's eldest grandson,

03:11.560 --> 03:13.080
was also involved in the fraud.

03:14.960 --> 03:16.199
The evidence is conclusive.

04:36.260 --> 04:37.008
=Blossoms of Power=

04:37.008 --> 04:40.300
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

04:40.300 --> 04:43.020
=Episode 20=

04:43.780 --> 04:45.750
(East Palace)

04:46.048 --> 04:47.830
Xihe, you came to see me
on your own accord.

04:47.839 --> 04:49.120
I assume regarding your cousin,

04:49.504 --> 04:51.160
your aunt has already pleaded with you.

04:51.536 --> 04:53.312
You guessed correctly, Your Highness.

04:53.879 --> 04:55.360
Xihe, I...

04:55.480 --> 04:56.879
You don't need to say anything.

04:57.296 --> 04:58.930
There's no need to show him favoritism.

04:58.959 --> 05:00.279
Since my cousin made a mistake,

05:00.279 --> 05:02.639
he should be dealt with accordingly.

05:03.000 --> 05:04.432
People must always pay the price

05:04.464 --> 05:05.720
for the mistakes they make.

05:05.824 --> 05:07.350
Only then can they learn their lesson

05:07.360 --> 05:09.439
and hold reverence for the law.

05:09.600 --> 05:11.312
Then what about
your grandfather's family?

05:11.800 --> 05:12.879
How do you consider them?

05:12.879 --> 05:14.160
My grandfather is not at fault.

05:14.560 --> 05:16.800
No one can use this
to falsely accuse him.

05:17.920 --> 05:20.560
As for whether my aunt
will hold a grudge against me,

05:21.079 --> 05:22.680
that is not my concern.

05:22.912 --> 05:24.070
I have a clear conscience.

05:28.784 --> 05:30.510
Why are you looking at me like that?

05:30.720 --> 05:31.839
Along this journey,

05:32.704 --> 05:35.140
you clearly need the support
of your maternal family the most,

05:35.959 --> 05:37.959
yet you risk offending the Tao family

05:38.000 --> 05:39.740
to place righteousness
above family loyalty.

05:39.759 --> 05:40.519
I can see that

05:41.160 --> 05:42.319
you're looking forward to

05:43.120 --> 05:44.879
a peaceful and prosperous nation.

05:46.360 --> 05:49.000
Qingzhi once sent me a policy essay.

05:49.000 --> 05:51.560
Its insights were unique
and its arguments sweeping.

05:51.879 --> 05:53.279
The essay began by stating,

05:53.328 --> 05:55.070
"I have heard
that the essence of governance

05:55.070 --> 05:56.912
lies in equitable land distribution
and the people's peace.

05:56.944 --> 05:59.840
The teachings on regulating water
and land are still fresh in our minds.

05:59.872 --> 06:01.560
Yet today, all fertile land
belongs to the wealthy,

06:01.560 --> 06:02.940
while the poor have not even
a sliver of land to stand on."

06:02.959 --> 06:04.439
You remember it word for word.

06:05.160 --> 06:06.600
The writing was so bold,

06:06.600 --> 06:08.040
and it's truly unforgettable.

06:13.600 --> 06:15.160
Back then, my only thought

06:15.360 --> 06:17.040
was to catch the person who poisoned me.

06:17.720 --> 06:18.759
Over time,

06:18.960 --> 06:20.920
my heart filled with resentment
and bitterness.

06:22.040 --> 06:24.279
The master at the Taoist temple
suggested I travel.

06:24.656 --> 06:26.368
Taking the imperial examination
at the time

06:26.400 --> 06:27.344
was just a whim.

06:30.240 --> 06:31.680
But I saw with my own eyes

06:32.320 --> 06:34.270
candidates getting the exam questions
in advance

06:34.592 --> 06:36.240
and swapping their papers on the spot,

06:37.519 --> 06:40.079
while the examiners turned a blind eye.

06:41.904 --> 06:43.870
I could have submitted a memorial
to the throne,

06:44.199 --> 06:45.160
but I knew

06:45.560 --> 06:46.879
even if I reported it then,

06:46.880 --> 06:49.040
it would only clean up
the local practices temporarily.

06:49.088 --> 06:50.944
It wouldn't serve
as a nationwide deterrent.

06:52.000 --> 06:52.839
What I want

06:53.360 --> 06:55.439
is a sweeping and decisive purge.

06:55.800 --> 06:57.040
For at least ten years,

06:57.480 --> 06:58.920
I want wrongdoers

06:58.928 --> 07:00.680
not to even dare harbor evil thoughts,

07:00.750 --> 07:02.144
and allow those with true ambition

07:02.240 --> 07:03.199
to stand out.

07:04.199 --> 07:05.879
Your time among the people back then

07:05.920 --> 07:08.040
is what makes you so clear-headed
and thorough today.

07:08.839 --> 07:09.959
But regarding this matter,

07:10.839 --> 07:12.240
how did you know it was me?

07:12.680 --> 07:13.879
I remember

07:14.079 --> 07:16.399
the candidate they later investigated

07:16.480 --> 07:17.639
was named Xiao Huaiqian.

07:20.800 --> 07:22.040
Xiao and Xiao sound the same.

07:22.480 --> 07:23.720
Hua was changed to Huai,

07:23.800 --> 07:26.759
turning outward brilliance
into inner depth.

07:27.360 --> 07:28.720
Yong was changed to Qian,

07:29.040 --> 07:31.279
turning noble arrogance
into a humble demeanor.

07:31.959 --> 07:33.199
It showed that the person

07:33.199 --> 07:35.160
wanted to hide his prominent identity.

07:36.319 --> 07:37.839
No matter how I disguise myself,

07:38.416 --> 07:39.950
you can always see right through it.

07:41.519 --> 07:42.959
Just like when we first met.

07:45.319 --> 07:46.399
I also know that

07:47.279 --> 07:49.600
while catching
the poisoner is important,

07:50.199 --> 07:51.800
what you never forget

07:52.144 --> 07:53.488
is eliminating the chronic poison

07:53.520 --> 07:55.430
that has seeped into the nation's veins.

07:55.720 --> 07:57.160
So regarding my cousin,

07:57.160 --> 07:58.279
you need not worry.

07:58.439 --> 08:00.720
Please enforce the law impartially
and set an example.

08:05.440 --> 08:07.000
Now that we've discussed everything,

08:07.056 --> 08:08.390
I should head back to the manor.

08:08.390 --> 08:09.312
Before you go back,

08:10.040 --> 08:12.120
I'd like to take you somewhere.

08:18.639 --> 08:19.079
Come.

08:20.360 --> 08:21.680
Here are your meatballs.

08:22.759 --> 08:23.759
Enjoy your meal.

08:38.759 --> 08:40.480
If others saw you right now,

08:40.960 --> 08:42.000
who would think

08:42.240 --> 08:44.670
you're the cold and heartless
Commandery Princess Zhaoning?

08:45.879 --> 08:47.519
If you could see yourself right now,

08:48.080 --> 08:49.360
you wouldn't think

08:49.480 --> 08:51.159
you're the calculating

08:51.159 --> 08:52.559
and deeply scheming Crown Prince.

09:20.120 --> 09:21.000
Slow down.

09:27.279 --> 09:28.200
You two,

09:28.279 --> 09:29.919
come in and guess some riddles!

09:30.380 --> 09:32.980
(A Lady Holding Up the Roof
Stabilizes the World)

09:34.799 --> 09:36.039
Do you know the answer?

09:37.039 --> 09:39.159
A roof radical over a lady

09:39.440 --> 09:41.030
combined with the character for "lady"

09:41.072 --> 09:42.640
makes the character "An" for peace.

09:42.704 --> 09:45.300
(Peace)

09:46.000 --> 09:47.200
It's a good riddle.

09:47.264 --> 09:48.480
For the world to be at peace,

09:48.720 --> 09:50.600
ladies should
naturally have their place.

09:58.919 --> 10:00.960
This riddle is quite unique.

10:01.088 --> 10:03.360
The bottom of "Qin"
is the character "He" for grain.

10:03.360 --> 10:05.159
Grain is wood, and water nurtures wood.

10:05.160 --> 10:06.992
Replacing it with water makes
the character "Tai" for prosperity.

10:07.080 --> 10:08.279
Only with abundant agriculture

10:08.340 --> 10:10.416
can the country prosper
and the people be at peace.

10:11.216 --> 10:12.440
(National Prosperity and Peace)

10:15.000 --> 10:17.360
Though I've long known
of your unmatched brilliance,

10:18.240 --> 10:19.120
every single time,

10:19.720 --> 10:21.120
you still manage to amaze me.

10:21.360 --> 10:23.799
It's the riddle maker
who hid the foundation of the state

10:24.000 --> 10:25.799
within the strokes of the characters.

10:25.856 --> 10:27.150
It's the foundation of the state

10:27.480 --> 10:28.639
hidden in your heart.

10:39.440 --> 10:40.559
Would you care

10:40.608 --> 10:42.720
to add a token of good fortune
to the blessing?

10:50.080 --> 10:51.240
In the royal court,

10:51.296 --> 10:53.472
I only wish for peace
and prosperity for the nation.

10:53.559 --> 10:54.720
But when I am with you,

10:55.120 --> 10:56.790
I only pray for our twin lotuses
to bloom.

11:40.720 --> 11:41.320
It's beautiful.

12:09.472 --> 12:11.240
The night is late and the dew is heavy.

12:11.360 --> 12:13.279
Couldn't I take care of it for you?

12:13.759 --> 12:15.559
Why must you trouble yourself?

12:15.919 --> 12:17.120
If you catch a cold,

12:17.130 --> 12:18.830
you'll have to drink
herbal medicine again.

12:18.840 --> 12:20.080
This flower is delicate.

12:20.759 --> 12:23.000
It will wither
if not carefully tended to.

12:23.728 --> 12:25.728
I wouldn't feel at ease
leaving it to others.

12:30.600 --> 12:31.200
Mo Yu,

12:31.360 --> 12:32.900
go fetch some more hot spring water.

12:32.919 --> 12:33.399
Yes.

12:48.320 --> 12:50.799
The reason this Slender-Leaf Qionghua
is so precious

12:50.799 --> 12:52.320
is that it can be used in medicine.

12:52.320 --> 12:54.600
It nourishes the yin,
protects the lungs, and detoxifies.

12:54.759 --> 12:56.679
The Crown Prince coughs frequently.

12:56.680 --> 12:58.430
Half of it is a disguise
in front of others,

12:58.440 --> 12:59.879
and half of it is real.

13:00.016 --> 13:03.100
I'm afraid the residual poison hasn't
been cleared and has damaged his lungs.

13:04.639 --> 13:06.879
So Her Highness works so hard

13:07.000 --> 13:08.440
all for the Crown Prince.

13:09.960 --> 13:11.000
Could this be

13:11.120 --> 13:13.080
what the storybooks call

13:13.399 --> 13:16.679
"the dawn of love
and deep-rooted affection"?

13:17.660 --> 13:20.060
(Residence of the Heir
of the Marquis of Shunan)

13:21.240 --> 13:22.039
Hurry up.

13:22.039 --> 13:22.759
Handle with care.

13:23.320 --> 13:23.799
Got it.

13:28.120 --> 13:29.399
That Cui Jinbai.

13:29.600 --> 13:30.879
I haven't seen him for days.

13:30.928 --> 13:33.120
He's been busy with Crown Prince
on the fraud case.

13:33.136 --> 13:34.680
I thought he had let me off the hook.

13:50.032 --> 13:51.504
- Young Master.
- Young Master.

13:53.344 --> 13:55.200
Look at how carefully
he's picking things out.

13:55.500 --> 13:56.480
Anyone who didn't know

13:56.592 --> 13:59.120
would think he's planning
to live here for thirty years.

14:01.120 --> 14:01.840
Halt.

14:04.639 --> 14:05.240
What is it?

14:05.344 --> 14:06.270
Where are you going?

14:07.056 --> 14:08.320
Just going out for a stroll.

14:08.320 --> 14:08.992
I'll go with you.

14:09.320 --> 14:10.480
No need.

14:12.480 --> 14:13.600
I suddenly feel

14:14.039 --> 14:15.200
a bit tired.

14:16.159 --> 14:17.399
I'll go back and rest.

14:17.399 --> 14:17.799
Alright.

14:18.880 --> 14:21.296
I have some business
at the Court of Judicial Review later.

14:21.440 --> 14:22.399
Get some good rest.

14:24.799 --> 14:25.440
Okay.

14:25.536 --> 14:26.480
You go do your thing.

14:26.480 --> 14:27.320
I won't bother you.

14:27.320 --> 14:27.759
See you.

14:36.279 --> 14:37.600
Young Master Bu,

14:37.679 --> 14:39.559
you haven't been here for days.

14:39.559 --> 14:41.200
It's not that I didn't want to come.

14:41.200 --> 14:42.559
During the fraud case,

14:42.560 --> 14:44.960
I had to keep a close eye
on the security of the capital.

14:48.799 --> 14:49.519
Yu'er,

14:49.584 --> 14:51.750
your little hands are getting
even softer and whiter.

14:53.960 --> 14:54.399
Come.

14:54.688 --> 14:56.840
Young Master Bu,
you're lingering among the beauties,

14:57.080 --> 14:58.159
looking quite delighted.

14:59.200 --> 15:00.440
Why are you here?

15:00.480 --> 15:02.368
You're playing around
with official courtesans.

15:02.370 --> 15:04.380
Do you know you've committed
the crime of corruption?

15:04.399 --> 15:05.559
Stop talking nonsense.

15:05.720 --> 15:06.919
Don't think because you're
in the Court of Judicial Review

15:06.919 --> 15:07.639
and have been a Vice Minister
for a few years,

15:07.640 --> 15:08.976
you can just pin crimes on people.

15:09.000 --> 15:10.500
In our dynasty, official courtesans
are performing artists

15:10.519 --> 15:11.650
belonging to the government.

15:11.840 --> 15:12.799
According to the law,

15:12.800 --> 15:15.200
officials who are overly intimate
with official courtesans

15:15.216 --> 15:16.630
face ten years in prison.

15:22.039 --> 15:24.360
I was just looking
at Yu'er's soft white hands

15:24.360 --> 15:25.559
and joking around a bit.

15:26.400 --> 15:28.030
It seems you know you're in the wrong.

15:28.600 --> 15:30.200
I can let this matter go for now,

15:30.480 --> 15:31.440
but you must promise me

15:31.440 --> 15:33.600
never to set foot
in these pleasure houses again.

15:37.568 --> 15:40.240
What gives you the right to deprive me
of my right to enjoy myself?

15:40.240 --> 15:41.830
Are you that inseparable
from singing and dancing?

15:41.840 --> 15:43.679
Yes. You don't know
how to appreciate it,

15:43.679 --> 15:44.759
and you want to stop others
from appreciating it too.

15:44.759 --> 15:45.840
You're simply unreasonable.

15:47.039 --> 15:47.480
Fine.

15:48.399 --> 15:49.320
I'll accompany you.

15:51.759 --> 15:53.120
He's accompanying you?

15:53.720 --> 15:54.720
Suit yourself.

16:04.080 --> 16:05.759
Do you know what dance this is?

16:07.759 --> 16:09.120
Isn't it just a water sleeve dance?

16:11.399 --> 16:12.759
This is the Qingshang dance.

16:12.832 --> 16:14.440
It originates
from the Han Dynasty Music Bureau.

16:14.440 --> 16:16.690
Specifically, the three Qingshang modes
of Xianghe songs.

16:16.840 --> 16:19.120
It features rare dances
and extraordinary talents.

16:19.760 --> 16:22.144
Several emperors of the
previous dynasties loved this dance.

16:22.192 --> 16:24.540
Later, it became widely popular
among the common people.

16:24.550 --> 16:27.620
The Music Office continuously absorbed
and improved upon folk music and dance,

16:27.630 --> 16:30.000
resulting in the spectacular performance
we see today.

16:34.879 --> 16:35.639
You may step down.

16:45.344 --> 16:47.670
Qian'er's pipa playing,
in the entire imperial capital,

16:47.879 --> 16:49.480
can be considered unparalleled.

16:51.399 --> 16:54.080
Then tell me, this piece,
White Snow in Spring Sunlight,

16:54.256 --> 16:55.824
what makes it so unparalleled?

16:59.840 --> 17:02.500
Spring Sunlight is derived
from all things sensing the spring,

17:02.519 --> 17:03.840
and the gentle, soothing breeze.

17:04.480 --> 17:05.160
White Snow

17:05.599 --> 17:07.079
is derived from awe-inspiring purity,

17:07.080 --> 17:08.672
and the crisp sound of snow on bamboo.

17:08.704 --> 17:10.590
Her playing technique
is beautiful and fluent.

17:11.160 --> 17:12.319
But it's too beautiful,

17:12.512 --> 17:14.550
thus losing the original intention
of this piece.

17:14.920 --> 17:16.160
Decadent music

17:16.839 --> 17:18.079
is truly inferior.

17:22.272 --> 17:23.110
Young Master Bu,

17:23.440 --> 17:24.359
do you know...

17:29.079 --> 17:31.680
- Young Master!
- Young Master!

17:38.160 --> 17:39.790
What's wrong, Young Master?

17:39.790 --> 17:40.830
Are you feeling unwell?

17:40.920 --> 17:41.750
My head hurts.

17:42.310 --> 17:43.400
Go bring

17:43.790 --> 17:45.070
Xie Yunhuai here.

17:45.310 --> 17:46.480
You may have caught a cold.

17:46.480 --> 17:47.510
I'll go get your medicine.

17:49.440 --> 17:50.240
Have you forgotten?

17:50.240 --> 17:51.780
Physician Xie
has gone beyond the frontier.

17:53.920 --> 17:54.720
Forget it.

17:57.440 --> 17:58.550
This is infuriating.

17:58.830 --> 17:59.680
Young Master Bu,

18:01.030 --> 18:02.200
where are you feeling unwell?

18:04.880 --> 18:05.960
What are you doing here?

18:06.270 --> 18:08.550
Don't you go to
the Court of Judicial Review?

18:09.250 --> 18:11.580
Is this how the Young Master's Residence
treats its guests?

18:11.590 --> 18:12.830
Won't you even offer me a seat?

18:14.420 --> 18:15.960
Do you really not want
to see me that much?

18:16.030 --> 18:16.750
What do you think?

18:17.070 --> 18:18.070
Every single day,

18:18.070 --> 18:19.200
you keep an eye on me
from morning till night.

18:19.200 --> 18:20.990
One of these days,
you're going to drive me crazy.

18:22.110 --> 18:24.000
If you could keep yourself in check,

18:24.030 --> 18:25.160
I wouldn't have to.

18:27.030 --> 18:28.160
Why should I?

18:28.210 --> 18:30.240
I've lived freely in the imperial capital
since I was a child.

18:30.270 --> 18:31.200
No one has ever tried
to keep me in line.

18:31.210 --> 18:33.000
I've long been used to
living without restraints.

18:33.030 --> 18:34.510
If you can't stand it, then move out.

18:34.720 --> 18:35.510
It suits us both.

18:39.910 --> 18:41.030
You're not leaving, are you?

18:41.680 --> 18:43.310
Fine. I'll go.

18:55.960 --> 18:56.680
Young Master.

18:57.300 --> 18:58.640
Although Physician Xie isn't here,

18:58.640 --> 19:00.470
a highly skilled foreign physician
has just arrived.

19:00.480 --> 19:01.830
I'll go invite him over.

19:11.400 --> 19:12.000
Get out.

19:12.720 --> 19:13.720
Just get out.

19:33.270 --> 19:34.510
Why are you sitting here?

19:34.510 --> 19:35.510
Waiting for you to calm down.

19:35.550 --> 19:36.680
Calm down?

19:36.960 --> 19:38.830
The moment I see you, I can't calm down.

19:40.310 --> 19:41.310
Then don't look at me.

19:51.920 --> 19:53.000
Lord Cui,

19:53.070 --> 19:54.480
I'm begging you.

19:54.590 --> 19:55.750
Will you just leave me alone?

19:57.480 --> 19:58.110
Fine.

19:59.200 --> 20:00.110
I promise.

20:00.210 --> 20:02.160
From now on, I'll try not to go
to those places so often.

20:02.160 --> 20:02.550
Good.

20:04.920 --> 20:06.400
But if you break your word,

20:07.240 --> 20:08.750
I'll do what I did today again.

20:24.980 --> 20:27.300
(East Palace)

20:27.520 --> 20:28.360
Your Highness.

20:29.490 --> 20:31.280
This time, I traveled
far beyond the borders

20:31.320 --> 20:33.090
and brought back
an extraordinary person.

20:33.160 --> 20:34.950
He is especially skilled
in detoxification.

20:34.990 --> 20:35.750
I took the liberty

20:35.830 --> 20:37.910
of having him diagnose you,
Your Highness.

20:38.190 --> 20:40.430
Greetings, Your Highness.

20:40.480 --> 20:42.370
Then I will trouble you, Physician Ale.

21:03.990 --> 21:05.350
How could His Highness's blood

21:05.600 --> 21:06.640
be like this?

21:20.750 --> 21:21.520
Tell me,

21:22.310 --> 21:23.560
how much time do I have left?

21:24.710 --> 21:26.280
Originally, you had three to five years.

21:27.080 --> 21:28.040
But Your Highness,

21:28.500 --> 21:31.120
you've risked your life several times
and damaged your meridians.

21:31.750 --> 21:32.600
Now,

21:35.080 --> 21:36.190
you only have one year left.

21:50.150 --> 21:51.560
Is it truly beyond saving?

21:54.280 --> 21:55.670
There is one more method.

21:57.640 --> 21:58.900
This set of golden needles

21:59.030 --> 22:01.800
has been soaked in a poison-drawing
decoction Ale specially formulated.

22:01.860 --> 22:04.390
They can be inserted into acupoints
to fight poison with poison.

22:04.470 --> 22:05.470
However, this method,

22:05.950 --> 22:07.280
compared to previous treatments,

22:07.300 --> 22:08.950
will be a hundred times more painful.

22:09.120 --> 22:10.280
A hundred times more painful?

22:10.900 --> 22:12.430
The previous poison treatments

22:12.440 --> 22:14.660
were as painful
as scraping bone and piercing the heart.

22:14.840 --> 22:16.390
How can His Highness endure this?

22:16.800 --> 22:17.670
Speak freely.

22:18.520 --> 22:19.990
There are twelve needles in total.

22:20.320 --> 22:21.670
Three needles break mortal bones.

22:23.150 --> 22:25.040
Twelve needles shatter the soul.

22:25.600 --> 22:26.670
By the eighth needle,

22:27.470 --> 22:29.080
even the toughest man

22:29.490 --> 22:31.890
will be in so much pain
that his soul will shatter.

22:36.290 --> 22:37.880
You've experienced it yourself?

22:39.950 --> 22:40.640
Let me see.

22:48.640 --> 22:49.520
I am incompetent.

22:50.840 --> 22:52.290
I could only endure four needles.

22:53.360 --> 22:54.710
Why did you go to such lengths?

22:58.390 --> 22:59.670
You secured a title of honor

23:00.560 --> 23:01.670
for my mother.

23:01.990 --> 23:04.120
Your kindness to me
is as deep as the sea.

23:04.840 --> 23:06.360
Even if my body is smashed to pieces,

23:06.950 --> 23:08.280
I am willing to do it.

23:14.800 --> 23:15.840
We will use this method.

23:21.750 --> 23:22.750
Whenever I think of her,

23:24.950 --> 23:25.950
I know I cannot die.

23:28.360 --> 23:29.990
As long as I can stay by her side,

23:31.990 --> 23:33.150
even one more day is good.

23:56.670 --> 23:58.360
Your Highness, why did you summon me

23:58.360 --> 23:59.190
to the palace?

23:59.430 --> 24:00.600
I've seen Yunhuai.

24:01.560 --> 24:03.040
He told me some good news.

24:03.670 --> 24:04.670
What good news?

24:07.390 --> 24:08.390
Yunhuai said

24:08.950 --> 24:09.840
right now,

24:10.360 --> 24:12.230
I don't even have three
to five years left.

24:13.800 --> 24:14.910
That's good news?

24:16.900 --> 24:19.010
You won't have to keep your guard up
against me.

24:19.320 --> 24:20.470
Isn't that good news?

24:27.910 --> 24:29.230
How much time is left?

24:32.190 --> 24:32.800
One year.

24:45.880 --> 24:47.390
This might not be a bad thing.

24:48.320 --> 24:50.320
After all, what you valued in me
from the start

24:50.670 --> 24:51.520
was my short life.

24:55.750 --> 24:57.080
Why don't we make a deal?

24:59.080 --> 24:59.910
What deal?

25:00.430 --> 25:01.670
My lifelong wish

25:02.470 --> 25:03.430
is to marry you.

25:03.700 --> 25:05.040
If you are willing to marry me,

25:05.470 --> 25:06.750
I will form an alliance with you,

25:07.140 --> 25:09.600
and help you keep the Shen family
and the Northwest Army safe.

25:09.800 --> 25:10.640
Everything you want,

25:11.230 --> 25:12.430
I will give to you.

25:12.600 --> 25:14.390
You believe
that people's hearts are fickle.

25:14.680 --> 25:17.040
Even if I were to have a change of heart
after we marry,

25:17.170 --> 25:19.150
I wouldn't live long enough
to be your enemy.

25:20.040 --> 25:21.560
If you become the Crown Princess,

25:21.670 --> 25:23.220
it will make things much easier for you.

25:23.560 --> 25:25.710
You can also help me fulfill
my unfulfilled wishes.

25:28.230 --> 25:29.430
Your wish

25:29.910 --> 25:31.470
is to find the one who poisoned you?

25:33.520 --> 25:34.360
It used to be.

25:35.320 --> 25:36.230
Now,

25:37.560 --> 25:38.390
not entirely.

25:41.990 --> 25:43.040
This poison

25:43.630 --> 25:45.800
should not become a curse
that traps me.

25:46.750 --> 25:48.520
No matter how much time
heaven grants me,

25:50.080 --> 25:51.360
I should do more

25:51.840 --> 25:53.150
meaningful things for the world.

25:59.090 --> 26:01.300
These are the dates chosen
by the Ministry of Rites.

26:02.420 --> 26:04.290
If you are willing
to join hands with me,

26:04.390 --> 26:05.280
then pick one.

26:09.600 --> 26:11.360
But don't pick one too far
in the future.

26:13.410 --> 26:15.040
I'm afraid I won't live to see it.

26:31.120 --> 26:32.430
As for your words today,

26:34.430 --> 26:35.640
I will consider them carefully.

26:37.360 --> 26:38.080
Xihe,

26:39.120 --> 26:40.470
every word you say,

26:41.600 --> 26:42.520
every single syllable,

26:43.880 --> 26:45.430
I will keep firmly in my heart.

26:49.160 --> 26:51.390
If you want to say something
that will break my heart,

26:53.670 --> 26:54.880
don't say it lightly.

27:04.700 --> 27:07.060
(Auspicious Day for Marriage: 10th Day
of the 2nd Month, 23rd Year of Youning)

27:07.060 --> 27:09.420
(Auspicious Day for Marriage: 2nd Day
of the 3rd Month, 23rd Year of Youning)

27:09.420 --> 27:11.300
(Auspicious Day for Marriage: 8th Day
of the 5th Month, 23rd Year of Youning)

27:22.900 --> 27:25.340
♪A wall that collapses at a single push♪

27:26.340 --> 27:28.940
♪Frost that melts at a single smile♪

27:29.980 --> 27:35.100
♪How can you be this wonderful♪

27:37.180 --> 27:39.980
♪I've hidden so many words♪

27:40.660 --> 27:43.380
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

27:44.340 --> 27:51.540
♪So never uncover♪

27:51.540 --> 27:54.220
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

27:54.580 --> 27:57.620
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

27:58.640 --> 27:59.950
I was picking Immortal Vine,

28:00.370 --> 28:01.520
and happened to save you.

28:03.230 --> 28:04.280
Save me...

28:05.390 --> 28:06.670
That was our first encounter.

28:07.250 --> 28:09.120
There was absolutely
no scheming involved.

28:11.910 --> 28:13.280
But as long as you believe

28:14.360 --> 28:16.080
that I will never hurt you,

28:16.880 --> 28:17.470
that is enough.

28:20.840 --> 28:21.800
Do you know

28:21.830 --> 28:23.560
why it withers once it leaves the water?

28:24.990 --> 28:26.040
Because it was born

28:26.950 --> 28:28.750
to be bathed in the gaze of lovers.

28:32.800 --> 28:33.840
Do you know

28:34.600 --> 28:35.800
how much I wanted you to ask,

28:37.360 --> 28:38.360
"Where are you going?"

28:39.060 --> 28:40.400
"What are you going to do?"

28:41.980 --> 28:44.700
♪Give you a moon in return♪

28:45.950 --> 28:46.950
Since I was nine,

28:47.880 --> 28:49.560
I haven't known what joy is.

28:51.360 --> 28:52.190
But now,

28:53.750 --> 28:54.560
I know.

28:56.190 --> 28:57.470
It is being with you.

28:58.040 --> 28:59.390
I'm very easy to coax.

29:00.430 --> 29:01.560
Even if it's a lie,

29:02.190 --> 29:03.320
I'm willing to believe it.

29:04.670 --> 29:06.120
I wonder if you would be willing

29:07.080 --> 29:07.800
to marry me.

29:10.060 --> 29:13.500
♪You'll never♪

29:14.060 --> 29:23.220
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

29:42.740 --> 29:45.140
♪Wind that misses the grasp♪

29:46.180 --> 29:48.660
♪Light that ignites at a single touch♪

29:49.700 --> 29:54.900
♪A person can find strength
time and again♪

29:57.220 --> 29:59.660
♪Our past♪

30:00.380 --> 30:03.340
♪Has been full of ups and downs
along the way♪

30:04.100 --> 30:07.660
♪Admitting my confusion
just like your regret♪

30:07.660 --> 30:10.900
♪How hard can it be?♪

30:10.950 --> 30:12.280
Your knot

30:12.370 --> 30:14.150
looks more exquisite
the more I look at it.

30:15.840 --> 30:17.150
I wonder when

30:18.670 --> 30:20.150
I will also be on someone's mind,

30:21.910 --> 30:23.120
and have someone

30:24.320 --> 30:25.950
pray for my good fortune and longevity.

30:25.950 --> 30:31.380
♪Stepping out of this long game
of hide-and-seek♪

30:32.420 --> 30:38.420
♪The flustered mortal world♪

30:39.780 --> 30:45.900
♪Your eyes remain clear and bright♪

31:04.980 --> 31:09.420
(East Palace)

31:15.910 --> 31:16.710
I thought

31:18.360 --> 31:19.150
you wouldn't come.

31:19.520 --> 31:20.600
Since you invited me,

31:20.950 --> 31:22.080
I would naturally come.

31:26.640 --> 31:27.430
So,

31:28.990 --> 31:30.190
what is your answer?

31:34.800 --> 31:36.080
For that one year,

31:37.430 --> 31:39.280
I'll be a good wife to you.

31:48.710 --> 31:49.230
Don't move.

31:59.990 --> 32:00.990
You know very well

32:02.230 --> 32:04.670
I'm only marrying you
because you have one year left to live.

32:05.880 --> 32:07.080
Yet you're still so happy.

32:09.540 --> 32:11.800
Each dawn, each dusk,
each moment together,

32:12.670 --> 32:13.840
that will be a lifetime.

32:15.390 --> 32:16.190
My life

32:17.280 --> 32:18.390
rises and sets like the sun.

32:19.560 --> 32:20.320
My heart

32:21.800 --> 32:23.040
remains unchanged for eternity.

32:29.150 --> 32:30.640
I chose the nearest auspicious date.

32:41.100 --> 32:43.360
(Yong'an Hall)

32:43.360 --> 32:44.080
Grandmother,

32:44.120 --> 32:45.840
I came to see you as soon as I returned.

32:46.560 --> 32:48.430
What a filial child.

32:48.430 --> 32:49.670
How has your health been lately?

32:49.670 --> 32:50.710
Good.

32:52.360 --> 32:53.990
Greetings, Your Highness.

32:54.520 --> 32:55.320
You may rise.

33:03.620 --> 33:05.220
Greetings, Commandery Princess.

33:06.080 --> 33:07.280
Greetings, Your Highness.

33:09.670 --> 33:12.120
I asked Xihe to come keep me company.

33:12.190 --> 33:14.520
She is about to marry the Crown Prince.

33:14.520 --> 33:15.320
Soon,

33:15.470 --> 33:17.640
she will become your sister-in-law.

33:24.520 --> 33:26.640
I heard you will stay in the capital.

33:27.230 --> 33:27.800
Yes.

33:28.400 --> 33:29.540
Father has issued a decree,

33:29.560 --> 33:31.790
appointing me
as the General of the Gallant Cavalry.

33:31.800 --> 33:33.240
Congratulations, Your Highness.

33:35.040 --> 33:36.120
I always remember

33:36.990 --> 33:38.950
the times I spent with you.

33:39.940 --> 33:42.530
Taking care of the children
in Gudu Garden together,

33:42.530 --> 33:45.400
paying respects to the fallen soldiers
at the cemetery together.

33:46.950 --> 33:47.950
Far away in Anlan,

33:48.150 --> 33:49.390
in the dead of night,

33:49.910 --> 33:51.950
I sometimes regretted
leaving the imperial capital.

33:53.470 --> 33:55.280
You are a born soldier.

33:55.720 --> 33:57.040
At that time, the imperial capital

33:57.090 --> 33:59.300
wasn't the best place for you
to showcase your talents.

33:59.430 --> 34:00.800
Your ideals and ambitions

34:00.880 --> 34:02.080
belong on the battlefield.

34:02.390 --> 34:04.390
Defending the country
is beyond reproach.

34:05.190 --> 34:06.360
You made the right choice.

34:10.840 --> 34:11.710
Don't worry.

34:12.520 --> 34:14.280
I didn't come back this time
to pester you.

34:19.190 --> 34:20.280
The past is in the past.

34:21.230 --> 34:22.470
I only wish you

34:23.230 --> 34:24.230
a smooth future

34:24.750 --> 34:25.800
and to follow your heart.

34:49.560 --> 34:50.560
I invited you here today

34:51.080 --> 34:52.600
to pick out your wedding dress.

34:53.650 --> 34:55.030
All the ceremonies for our wedding

34:55.080 --> 34:57.710
are handled by the Palace Administration
and various departments,

34:57.760 --> 34:59.760
in coordination
with the Ministry of Ceremonies.

34:59.950 --> 35:02.040
But Xihe, you should
choose what you like.

35:02.600 --> 35:03.360
Take your time.

35:04.640 --> 35:06.040
I only hope that on the wedding day,

35:06.390 --> 35:07.880
I can see joy in your eyes.

35:09.040 --> 35:10.840
Thank you for your trouble,
Your Highness.

35:11.470 --> 35:13.430
This booklet follows
the royal regulations

35:13.430 --> 35:14.670
for your wedding attire.

35:14.840 --> 35:16.290
Please take a look, Your Highness.

35:16.310 --> 35:18.320
(Crown Prince's Wedding Attire Catalog)

35:18.320 --> 35:19.320
If I may, Your Highness,

35:19.670 --> 35:21.120
royal weddings in our dynasty

35:21.120 --> 35:23.640
favor bright colors,
usually with crimson as the main color,

35:23.750 --> 35:25.360
paired with various patterns.

35:42.360 --> 35:44.080
This white pattern is so unique.

35:44.320 --> 35:45.670
It looks like a sky full of stars.

35:46.320 --> 35:47.320
All the wedding dresses

35:47.620 --> 35:50.680
will be made according to Commandery
Princess Zhaoning's preferences.

35:50.850 --> 35:51.920
Yes, Your Highness.

35:58.700 --> 36:05.580
(Auspicious)

36:25.470 --> 36:26.230
Your Highness,

36:26.640 --> 36:28.150
the pearls on this veil

36:28.360 --> 36:30.950
were personally selected for you
by the Crown Prince.

36:31.230 --> 36:33.150
And he strung them one by one

36:33.150 --> 36:34.470
with his own hands.

36:34.710 --> 36:35.840
This shows

36:35.910 --> 36:38.190
His Highness's sincerity
in marrying you.

36:44.080 --> 36:44.750
Put it on.

37:24.640 --> 37:27.830
Her Highness looks like
a fairy descending to earth.

37:28.710 --> 37:30.600
Why are you crying on such a joyous day?

37:38.340 --> 37:40.400
The bridal procession
from the East Palace is here!

38:10.640 --> 38:11.960
Please have a seat, you two.

38:13.790 --> 38:14.520
I'm not tired.

38:19.750 --> 38:21.920
The Commandery Princess has arrived.

39:44.600 --> 39:46.000
Bow.

39:52.710 --> 39:54.520
Bow again.

40:05.520 --> 40:06.480
Xihe,

40:07.400 --> 40:08.920
your father and brother are not here.

40:09.310 --> 40:12.440
Today, your uncle and I

40:13.190 --> 40:14.710
will see you off to your marriage.

40:15.270 --> 40:16.440
May the two of you

40:17.040 --> 40:18.920
be of one mind and heart,

40:19.150 --> 40:20.870
respect each other,

40:21.440 --> 40:23.120
tie the knot forever,

40:24.040 --> 40:26.120
and form a lifelong bond.

40:27.920 --> 40:29.750
I wish you

40:30.580 --> 40:32.880
mutual respect and harmony
in your marriage.

40:33.440 --> 40:34.960
May you live in harmony,

40:35.790 --> 40:37.190
continue the family line,

40:38.040 --> 40:40.560
and grow old together.

40:41.640 --> 40:43.080
Grandfather and Uncle, I will always

40:44.040 --> 40:46.080
keep your earnest teachings in my heart.

40:48.920 --> 40:50.310
Don't miss the auspicious hour.

40:50.830 --> 40:51.640
Go.

40:53.870 --> 40:55.600
The bride departs!

42:06.710 --> 42:07.310
Set off.

42:27.480 --> 42:29.030
Your Highness, please behave yourself.

42:29.150 --> 42:31.480
On our wedding night,
with my beautiful bride,

42:31.830 --> 42:33.150
perhaps you could teach me

42:33.440 --> 42:34.400
how to behave.

42:34.870 --> 42:38.190
Your Highness,
you and Xihe are newlyweds,

42:38.670 --> 42:41.080
but you should still
exercise some restraint.

42:47.031 --> 42:49.971
♪I've hidden so many words♪

42:50.591 --> 42:53.391
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

42:54.261 --> 43:01.231
♪So never uncover♪

43:01.421 --> 43:03.781
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

43:04.911 --> 43:07.641
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

43:08.601 --> 43:13.941
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

43:15.701 --> 43:18.521
♪Every answer I gave♪

43:19.321 --> 43:22.171
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

43:22.961 --> 43:26.331
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

43:26.591 --> 43:29.901
♪How hard it truly was?♪

43:32.871 --> 43:36.311
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

43:37.301 --> 43:39.631
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

43:40.901 --> 43:46.661
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

43:48.071 --> 43:51.201
♪It's a shame I never could♪

43:51.651 --> 43:54.661
♪Give you a moon in return♪

43:54.771 --> 44:01.411
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

44:01.411 --> 44:05.081
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

44:05.951 --> 44:08.711
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

44:09.151 --> 44:12.281
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

44:12.721 --> 44:18.671
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

44:20.071 --> 44:23.621
♪You'll never♪

44:23.901 --> 44:33.371
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

44:59.541 --> 45:03.021
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
